      "content": "9. Standard Abbreviations in Engineering Drawing"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "First Angle Projection vs Third Angle Projection: Remember that in 1st angle, the top view lies below the front view, while in 3rd angle, the top view lies above the front view.",
        "Line Types and Thickness: Standard ratio of thick to thin line thickness is 2:1 (e.g., 0.5 mm thick and 0.25 mm thin).",
        "Cutting Plane Lines: Identified by thin chain lines with thick ends and direction arrows."
      ],
      "id": "ob17xt7"
